xScanner paper-trading UI

The floating panel, PnL card, chart markers, poster backgrounds and portfolio
view in this tree are original xScanner code. The six poster backgrounds are
generated in the browser (gradient, aurora, candles, moon, grid, noise). They
are not taken from Simora or from any other product.

No source was copied from paper-ape, papertrench, GhostPaper, AgentLouie/paper-trader,
or dryflip/memecoin-paper-trading-extension. Those repositories were not vendored.
